
[l_english.DECISION_C12_HOLD_A_SOCIAL_PARTY_WITH_APPLELOOSA]
Hold a social party with Appleloosa

[l_english.DECISION_C12_HOLD_A_SOCIAL_PARTY_WITH_APPLELOOSA_desc]
Under the meticulous planning and organization of Cheese Sandwich, the greatest party planner in all of Equestria, the Rock Farm will host a grand celebration in Appaloosa, where every pony attending can briefly forget the worries and sorrows of reality and simply revel in joy.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_HOLD_A_SOCIAL_PARTY_WITH_APPLELOOSA]
与苹果鲁萨举办联谊派对

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_HOLD_A_SOCIAL_PARTY_WITH_APPLELOOSA_desc]
在全小马利亚最棒的派对举办者————芝士·三明治的精心筹备和策划下，采石农场将在苹果鲁萨举办一场盛大的欢乐派对，所有参与的小马都可以短暂忘却现实的烦恼和悲伤
